  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Presentation & Synthesis Support\r\n\r\nUse this chat to organize how you explain your project to an audience. It can help you practice describing what your app does, how it changed over time, and why you made the decisions you did.\r\n\r\nThis chat supports **communication and reflection**, not further planning or building.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n> I’m getting ready to present my project and I’m not sure how to explain it clearly. Can you help me organize what to say?\r\n\r\n> I want to explain how my app changed from the beginning to the final version. Can you help me tell that story?\r\n\r\n> I made a lot of decisions during this project, and I’m not sure which ones are most important to highlight. Can you help me reflect?\r\n\r\n> I’m nervous about explaining my project to an audience. Can you help me practice describing it in a clear, confident way?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
